# Biome formats every file with LF (`biome.json` → `formatter.lineEnding`).
# Force LF in the working tree too: this machine has `core.autocrlf=true`, and
# without this line a fresh checkout would hand Biome CRLF files and fail
# `bun run check` on line endings alone. Also keeps the `.claude` → `.agents`
# symlink hashing identically on Windows and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
